  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        74.08379364013672,
        196.92959594726562,
        88.43879699707031
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        95.19841766357422,
        517.6083374023438,
        109.75141906738281
      ],
      "text": "1.4 The following treatment administration options may be offered to patients on TB treatment:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.85040283203125,
        111.56043243408203,
        477.38812255859375,
        126.00343322753906
      ],
      "text": "a.\tCommunity- or home-based treatment support is recommended over health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.85040283203125,
        122.28443145751953,
        452.0177917480469,
        138.00343322753906
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional  facility-based treatment support or unsupported treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.85040283203125,
        134.28443908691406,
        347.83099365234375,
        149.9484405517578
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, moderate certainty of evidence).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.85040283203125,
        151.81239318847656,
        505.7015075683594,
        166.25538635253906
      ],
      "text": "b.\tTreatment support by trained lay providers or health-care workers is recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.85040283203125,
        162.53639221191406,
        502.5753173828125,
        178.25538635253906
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional  over treatment support by family members or unsupported treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.85040283203125,
        174.53639221191406,
        341.7830810546875,
        190.2003936767578
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, very low certainty of evidence).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.85040283203125,
        192.0644073486328,
        515.4912109375,
        206.5074005126953
      ],
      "text": "c.\t Video-supported treatment (VST) may replace in-person treatment support when the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.85040283203125,
        204.0644073486328,
        505.6390075683594,
        218.5074005126953
      ],
      "text": "video communication technology is available and it can be appropriately organized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.85040283203125,
        214.7884063720703,
        501.24053955078125,
        230.5074005126953
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation,  and operated by health-care providers and patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.85040283203125,
        226.7884063720703,
        259.3260803222656,
        242.45240783691406
      ],
      "text": "very low certainty of evidence).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.6886901855469,
        139.9644775390625,
        283.5406799316406
      ],
      "text": "Justification",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.88861083984375,
        172.38133239746094,
        315.5486145019531
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.7565002441406,
        527.4649047851562,
        337.19952392578125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support terminology in this document is used to describe an approach to supporting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.9565124511719,
        527.3804321289062,
        350.3995361328125
      ],
      "text": "patients who are taking prescribed doses of TB medicines in order to help ensure adherence to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.156494140625,
        524.4818725585938,
        363.5995178222656
      ],
      "text": "treatment and maximize its efficacy. Treatment support needs to be provided in the context of people-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966650009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.35650634765625,
        527.4387817382812,
        376.7995300292969
      ],
      "text": "centred care and should be based on the individual patient’s needs, acceptability and preferences. It",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.5565185546875,
        527.407958984375,
        389.9995422363281
      ],
      "text": "includes aspects of support, motivation and understanding of patients without coercion. Historically,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        388.7565002441406,
        527.400146484375,
        403.19952392578125
      ],
      "text": "this group of interventions were labelled as “directly observed treatment” or DOT. However, with a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.9565124511719,
        527.40673828125,
        416.3995361328125
      ],
      "text": "need to emphasize the need to support people in adhering to treatment, as recommended by the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.8804931640625,
        527.5264892578125,
        429.5995178222656
      ],
      "text": "(6, 7) WHO TB ethics guidance of 2010 and 2017  , this legacy terminology has been replaced by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.35650634765625,
        527.4078979492188,
        442.7995300292969
      ],
      "text": "“treatment support” throughout this document in order to align the language with the essence of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.5565185546875,
        317.0428466796875,
        455.9995422363281
      ],
      "text": "the recommendation of the WHO TB ethics guidance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.260498046875,
        527.2010498046875,
        477.7035217285156
      ],
      "text": "In the systematic review that led to the recommendations on treatment adherence, “treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.46051025390625,
        527.1900634765625,
        490.9035339355469
      ],
      "text": "support” was defined as any person observing the patient taking medications in real time. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        489.6604919433594,
        527.43994140625,
        504.103515625
      ],
      "text": "treatment supporter does not need to be a health-care worker, but could be a friend, a relative or a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.8604736328125,
        291.4183654785156,
        517.303466796875
      ],
      "text": "lay person who works as a treatment supporter.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.5643920898438,
        527.3846435546875,
        539.0073852539062
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support may also be achieved with real-time video feed and video recording which is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.764404296875,
        489.40191650390625,
        552.2073974609375
      ],
      "text": "referred to as video-supported treatment (VST). VST was analysed separately in this review.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.46826171875,
        527.5357055664062,
        573.9112548828125
      ],
      "text": "Adherence definitions varied across the studies. In general, however, adherence was defined as taking",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979180335998535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.6683349609375,
        411.0818786621094,
        587.111328125
      ],
      "text": "> 90% of medications under conditions of observation by another person.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.3721923828125,
        527.376220703125,
        608.815185546875
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review conducted in support of this guideline was based on synthesis of data from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.2963256835938,
        527.4169921875,
        622.0153198242188
      ],
      "text": "(8–15) (16–29) randomized controlled trials   and from observational studies  , with preference given to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.7723388671875,
        527.4410400390625,
        635.21533203125
      ],
      "text": "the results of randomized controlled trials. Outcomes from treatment support with observation were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.9722900390625,
        527.4100341796875,
        648.415283203125
      ],
      "text": "compared with outcomes from self-administered treatment (SAT) given under standard TB practice",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.1723022460938,
        527.4288330078125,
        661.6152954101562
      ],
      "text": "and without any additional support. Treatment support could be given by a health-care worker, a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.3721923828125,
        527.46728515625,
        674.815185546875
      ],
      "text": "family member or a community member and could be done at home, in the patient’s community",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        673.5723266601562,
        527.3399047851562,
        688.0153198242188
      ],
      "text": "or at a clinic. Treatment support was generally performed daily. The GDG focused preferentially",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.7723388671875,
        527.4365844726562,
        701.21533203125
      ],
      "text": "on randomized controlled trial data from the systematic review. When the data from randomized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.9722900390625,
        527.434326171875,
        714.415283203125
      ],
      "text": "controlled trials were limited or not available, observational data were examined and their results",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.1723022460938,
        527.4464721679688,
        727.6152954101562
      ],
      "text": "were presented. Interpretation of the associations, however, requires caution due to limitations of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.3721923828125,
        527.3893432617188,
        740.815185546875
      ],
      "text": "the observational data when the associations are confounded by different factors. In uncontrolled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        739.5723266601562,
        527.0999755859375,
        754.0153198242188
      ],
      "text": "observational studies, for instance, patients with more severe disease or higher risk of non-adherence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9822359085083,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        752.7723388671875,
        527.4465942382812,
        767.21533203125
      ],
      "text": "are likely to be assigned treatment support and the less sick or, less likely, incompliant patients are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "182 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}